0	section	Searching the notice board
1	box	You search through the notice board...
1	line	Player	'Damaged roof tiles for sale'... 'Come on down to Bob's Axes'... 'Contributions welcomed to Ned's New-Window Fund'...
1	line	Player	Wait a minute, what's this?
1	box	'Keen fighter sought to deal with troublesome monster. Reward offered. Speak to Sarah at the South Falador Farm for details.'
1	line	Player	This could be worth looking into.
1	select	Start the A Porcine of Interest quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	Right, let's go and see what Sarah has in mind.
2	action	end
