0	section	Talking to Sarah
0	section	Initial conversation
1	line	Sarah	Hello. How can I help you?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Talk about the bounty.
2	line	Player	I've come about the bounty.
2	line	Sarah	Oh thank Saradomin! It's about time someone responded, something needs to be done!
2	line	Player	Can you explain what happened?
2	line	Sarah	Of course. I was making my monthly delivery to The Sheared Ram in Lumbridge, heading east near the Draynor Village crossroads.
2	line	Sarah	Suddenly, out of the trees came a hulking monster! It chased me for a short distance, but luckily Rosie managed to spook it enough to give me a headstart.
2	line	Player	Sounds like it must have given you quite the scare!
2	line	Sarah	It certainly did. I even lost my cart full of farm produce!
2	select	Select an option
2	option	What did the monster look like?
3	line	Player	What did this monster look like?
3	line	Sarah	I didn't get a very good look at it I'm afraid. It was getting dark and as soon as I saw it charging at me, I ran.
3	line	Sarah	I can still hear the sound, though. A horrible grunting... squealing...
3	line	Sarah	Is there anything else you wanted?
3	action	other
2	option	Any tips on finding this thing?
3	line	Player	Any tips on finding this thing?
3	line	Sarah	Tips...? You're supposed to be the professional monster slayer!
3	line	Sarah	Although, I suppose a good place to start would be checking the area I was attacked. See if you can find the remains of my cart.
3	line	Player	Ok, yes that could work.
3	line	Sarah	Is there anything else you wanted?
3	action	other
2	option	Whereabouts were you attacked again?
3	line	Player	Whereabouts were you attacked again?
3	line	Sarah	I remember being somewhere near the crossroads, north of Draynor Village.
3	line	Sarah	Sorry that I'm not much help. It happened so fast, the whole thing is a bit of a blur.
3	line	Player	That's okay. Crossroads north of Draynor... At least I have somewhere to start.
3	line	Sarah	Is there anything else you wanted?
3	action	other
2	option	You mentioned Rosie. Who's that?
3	line	Player	You mentioned that Rosie spooked the monster. Who's that?
3	line	Sarah	Oh, that'll be our lady over there by the fire. She's such a good dog, always accompanies me on deliveries.
3	line	Sarah	You can pet her if you like. She's very friendly.
3	line	Sarah	Is there anything else you wanted?
3	action	other
2	option	I think that'll be all for now.
3	line	Player	I think that'll be all for now.
3	line	Sarah	Excellent! Best of luck to you, I'll be waiting right here with your reward.
3	action	end
