1	option	Talk about the bounty.
2	line	Sarah	Oh it's you, my monster slayer! How goes the quest?
2	line	Player	I'm still working on it... I've managed to find its lair though.
2	line	Sarah	Sounds like you're making progress. Take care!
2	action	end
