1	line	Sarah	Hello. How can I help you?
1	option	Talk about the bounty.
2	line	Player	That monster certainly won't be troubling you from now on.
2	line	Sarah	Oh that's fantastic news! I'm so relie-
2	line	Sarah	Wait, how do I know you're not just saying that to get the bounty?
2	cond	If the player doesn't have the sourhog foot:
3	line	Player	I guess I'll go and get you some proof.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player has the sourhog foot:
3	line	Player	How about this as proof?
