3	line	Sarah	Eugh! Yes, that certainly looks about right!
3	line	Player	Indeed, the smell is... something quite special.
3	line	Sarah	I'll probably just give it to the dog.
3	line	Sarah	I'm glad you made it back. Some strange woman in a hood came asking about the job shortly after you left. I didn't really want her back in here.
3	line	Sarah	Anyway, thank you so much! Here's your reward.
3	box	Sarah hands you a heavy pouch of 5,000 coins.
3	line	Player	Perhaps I should speak with Spria and tell her that the monster's been dealt with.
3	action	end
