1	line	Sarah	Hello. How can I help you?
1	option	Talk about the bounty.
2	line	Player	Feeling better now that the monster's gone?
2	line	Sarah	Very much so! Thanks again. What was it, anyway?
2	line	Player	It was a Sourhog. A giant bipedal pig creature!
2	line	Sarah	Oh crumbs... I think I've heard of those... My grandfather was always rambling on about them.
2	line	Sarah	Nevermind... that's all history now. Weren't you heading off to see Spria?
2	line	Player	Yes, I suppose I should get going.
2	line	Sarah	Safe travels!
2	action	end
