0	section	Talking to Spria
1	line	Spria	'Ello, and what are you after then?
1	line	Player	I did it! I killed the Sourhog and collected the bounty from Sarah.
1	line	Spria	Very impressive, slayer. I'm glad that the goggles served you well.
1	line	Spria	Although, these Sourhogs often live in primitive tribes. I fear that where there's one, there's likely to be more to follow.
1	line	Spria	We may have to monitor that lair from time to time to keep their population in check.
1	action	continue
1	cond	If the player has unlocked the ability to craft the slayer helmet:
